msgstr[1] "%1$d மைல்கள்"

#.  first argument is a number (possible with point or comma), second argument
#. is superscript number (meaning 12 to the power of the argument), ‘Gf’ is a
#. unit of grafut (TGM, dozenal/duodecimal); watch out for spacing, and for
