#. distance in dozenal unit of grafut;
#. %1$s is formatted number, %2$s is superscript factor for larger distances
#. consult http://www.dozenalsociety.org.uk/pdfs/TGMbooklet.pdf,
#. https://dozenal.org/drupal/sites_bck/default/files/tgm_0.pdf, or Your local
#. dozenal society
